# rmtfs — Qualcomm modem userspace (rmtfs + libqrtr + tqftpserv), built FROM SOURCE via a
# qforge-owned PKGBUILD (packages/rmtfs/PKGBUILD). Needed by SM6115 (MANGMI Air X) for Wi-Fi: the
# WCN3950 WLAN firmware runs on the modem DSP, which only boots with rmtfs serving its EFS and
# tqftpserv serving its firmware. Not in the holo snapshot at all; see the PKGBUILD header for why
# the three daemons are one package.
#
# "Local PKGBUILD" form (like packages/rauc): build-overlay.sh uses the checked-in recipe; makepkg
# downloads the four upstream tag tarballs the PKGBUILD names, and prepare() checks their sums.
#
# After adding or bumping this: `make relock` (the package must land in rootfs/manifest.lock; it is
# listed in PKGS in rootfs/customize-base.sh).
name: rmtfs
pkgbuild_local: PKGBUILD
pkgrel_suffix: 1
